{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cubiw Dungeron is a <strong>roguelike</strong> where you control a smiling cube that has to destroy more cubes inside the dungeon, while grabbing items that make you stronger to overcome the progressively tougher rooms.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the dungeon</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dungeon, formed of multiple rooms,\u00a0different every time you play, every 10 rooms you will fight against a boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-3 areas with 2 bosses each</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-30 different enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-75 different items with unique variations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-More than 200 room combinations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-And more to come in the future</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Cubic Dungeon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983230/4dc9258cf0025c2fc6277db310b683cc07b37187.jpg"},{"name":"Basic victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983230/0af2b7496ea450fb7d6f62d97e493cb19d291f85.jpg"},{"name":"Smart victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983230/372f6a6f900d180e4c76c8adfaaf42f84377ab15.jpg"},{"name":"Old Version victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983230/efdb529fb19e01dcf724c5e821d5cd81fc1f400c.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983230/69ee151502486dd861b45e03662b2f0ed0339063.jpg"},{"name":"Weird victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983230/5ce2ead664d3c8d14bcbb2c98a050d0b45e140a1.jpg"},{"name":"Drawed Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3983230/a315a1b50b0bd253806b11561c8854e561dee0bc.jpg"},{"name":"Glassiw victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcomm